@prefix ad:    <https://meta.linked.archi/arch-decision#> .
@prefix aisep: <https://aisep.example/ont/aisep#> .

# Impact directions of the arch-decision relationship classes (spec §9). Loaded via this module's manifest
# (aisep:impactFile); only the classes declared here are traversed.
# ad:IncludesConcept (arch-decision.ttl: "a drawn link from an Option to a model concept that is part of the Option";
# its direct form ad:includesConcept ⊑ arch:hasPart): drawn from the Option (whole) to the concept (part). Same reading
# as arch:HasPart / am4:Aggregation: the candidate solution depends on the concepts it is made of, and a concept can be
# part of several Options without depending on any of them.
ad:IncludesConcept aisep:dependency aisep:Backward .
